Z||000002||fropuff||01-21-2001||11:23 AM||||Get the best body job that you can find.  After all, the other guy is paying for it, isn't he???   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Good luck!<P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who are worried about being caught.||||reg||1
